        "runId": "ada-en-mw6lyzli-ohxi6gztz2",
        "model": "ChatGPT Codex"
      },
      "text": "Spend the day at Machu Picchu, the ‘Lost City of the Incas’, on a group tour with an English-speaking guide. The most learned Inca priests are said to have retreated to Machu Picchu after the fall of the Inca Empire, and the Spanish never found the city. It was built at the top of a mountain, surrounded by dense, impassable jungle. Huge limestone blocks were fitted together without mortar. The American archaeologist Hiram Bingham found the site in 1911. Lunch. Return to Cusco by train, then transfer to your hotel on arrival."
    },
